      "context": "双机实测 §5Hypergolic Ionized Ceramics 的完整 Lore 说明。",
      "text": "First the gabagool fuel is vitrified through calcination, then stabilized using a phosphate-based crystalline ceramic host through an ion exchange, or something...",
